This is a production-quality backend.

Rules:

- Java 21
- Spring Boot 3
- Maven
- PostgreSQL

Architecture:

Controller
↓

Service
↓

Repository

Optimization Engine must remain independent from Spring.

Always:

- Constructor Injection
- DTO Pattern
- Validation
- Global Exception Handler
- Small methods
- Small classes
- SOLID
- DRY

Never:

- Field Injection
- God Classes
- Business Logic inside Controllers
- Expose Entities

Prefer:

- Composition over inheritance
- Interface-based design
- Immutable DTOs where practical

Only generate files explicitly requested.